    "detailed_description": "Players of Ultimate Protector need to protect a goddess statue from a large number of monsters which attempt to destroy it. At the meantime, in return of the protection, the goddess will offer \u201cgift\u201d which is able to upgrade the skill and weapon of the avatar. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no complicated control on this game, use WSAD to move and doge the monsters, all weapons are used automatically. <br />\r\n\uf06cSword <br />\r\n\uf06cThunder<br />\r\n\uf06cPotion <br />\r\n\uf06c\u2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDestroy the monsters and the experience gems will be collected by the goddess automatically and when it reaches a certain amount, the goddess will send out a \u201cgift\u201d, move close to it and upgrade the weapons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is 10 avatars to be selected, with different original weapon carried.<br />\r\n\uf06cJ. Torrance<br />\r\n\uf06cGregor<br />\r\n\uf06cShiranui<br />\r\n\uf06c\u2026.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMeanwhile, there are 5 elements and to combine different element with weapons, super weapons will be created. Also, if you are lucky enough, some super weapons are able to combined again and generate HPYER weapons. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your avatar, pick the \u2018gifts\u201d , upgrade the skills, discover super weapons and protect her!",
    "about_the_game": "Players of Ultimate Protector need to protect a goddess statue from a large number of monsters which attempt to destroy it. At the meantime, in return of the protection, the goddess will offer \u201cgift\u201d which is able to upgrade the skill and weapon of the avatar. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no complicated control on this game, use WSAD to move and doge the monsters, all weapons are used automatically. <br />\r\n\uf06cSword <br />\r\n\uf06cThunder<br />\r\n\uf06cPotion <br />\r\n\uf06c\u2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDestroy the monsters and the experience gems will be collected by the goddess automatically and when it reaches a certain amount, the goddess will send out a \u201cgift\u201d, move close to it and upgrade the weapons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is 10 avatars to be selected, with different original weapon carried.<br />\r\n\uf06cJ. Torrance<br />\r\n\uf06cGregor<br />\r\n\uf06cShiranui<br />\r\n\uf06c\u2026.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMeanwhile, there are 5 elements and to combine different element with weapons, super weapons will be created. Also, if you are lucky enough, some super weapons are able to combined again and generate HPYER weapons. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your avatar, pick the \u2018gifts\u201d , upgrade the skills, discover super weapons and protect her!",
    "short_description": "Tired of moving around without purposes? Come and protect the goddess with multiple combination of skills and elements. Discover and upgrade your weapon to super, even hyper! Play this game with a joy from both tower defense and rogue!",
